ub.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Purpose\nClose the remaining emulator-test gaps in Issue #46 without changing prices or store behavior.\n\n## Coverage added\n- Missing catalog version is rejected as invalid input.\n- Unknown SKU is rejected before any debit or receipt.\n- A catalog price/duration update creates a newer immutable version.\n- A new gift using the stale prior catalog version is rejected.\n- A new gift using the current version but stale expected price is rejected.\n- Sender balance and gift receipt count remain unchanged for all rejected requests.\n- Existing concurrent duplicate/replay test still verifies exactly one debit, one entitlement, immutable terms, sender-only debit and replay compatibility.\n\n## Safety\nTest-only change. No production prices, catalog entries, Firebase resources, billing, deployment or main merge.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-20T09:24:17Z","updated_at":"2026-11-23T20:22:13Z","closed_at":"2026-11-20T09:28:47Z","merged_at":"2026-11-20T09:28:47Z","merge_commit_sha":"b691d13dc5d74ab185f46e76bedd9c42d52cfa74","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"productionhome2022-hash:codex/phase1-store-gifting-catalog-version-regressions-2026-11-20","ref":"codex/phase1-store-gifting-catalog-version-regressions-2026-11-20","repo":{"id":1446343181,"node_id":"R_kgDOVjVyDQ","name":"mawda-platform","full_name":"productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform","owner":{"login":"productionhome2022-hash","id":348720557,"node_id":"U_kgDOFMkNrQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348720557?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash","html_url":